#
# Encoding scope: the alumina case study, Allegro and MACE trained on
# hydrostatically strained, vacancy-containing Al2O3 supercells (VASP
# PBE; 14,000 training, 1,500 test, 500 validation structures), with the
# R2 values stated in the text. Lattice, elastic, cohesive and vacancy
# properties (Table 1) and CPU performance (Fig. 4) against ReaxFF and
# COMB3 are properties or figure-only.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
